              "urpx:evaluationKind": {
                "@id": "urpx:coverageEvaluation"
              },
              "urpx:description": "This filing does not carry everything its source document states. 1 parts are deferred, listed here in the same words as the filing's tariff.toml [modeling].deferrals so the two records cannot drift. (1) Term, availability and sign-up. The percentage is selected annually for a one-year, self-renewing term; Green Power is limited, customers are added first come, first served, and the sign-up period and purchased quantities are at the Cooperative's discretion. The EligibilityRule carries enrollment in jemc:program-gp; these terms are in its description only.",
